      "title": "Order detail readable by any logged-in user",
      "description": "The order_detail view looks up the order by primary key only. It never checks that the order belongs to request.user. Any logged-in user can read the total and discount code of every order by iterating order ids. Filter the lookup by owner=request.user, as the redeem view already does.",
      "suggested_change": "    order = get_object_or_404(Order, pk=order_id, owner=request.user)",
      "source": null,
      "candidate": null,
