      "title": "CSRF protection disabled on session-authenticated POST",
      "description": "The redeem view changes order state for the session user, and the decorator turns off CSRF checks. The settings enable CsrfViewMiddleware, so the view opts out on purpose. Any third-party site can make a logged-in user's browser redeem codes on that user's orders. Remove the csrf_exempt decorator and have clients send the CSRF token.",
